<!--
  Avermere — Library default area.

  Ten-by-ten isometric room rendered with the Kenney isometric-miniature
  library kit (256x128 tile diamonds; PNG image is 256x512 because the
  building rises above the diamond footprint). Sprite PNGs are hosted on
  Cloudflare R2 at media.gamecodex.com/tile/library/iso/.

  Tilesets:
    1: floor      — floorCarpet_S.png        (walkable carpet)
    2: bookshelf  — bookcaseBooks_S.png      (decoration)
    3: tableLong  — longTableChairs_S.png    (decoration)
    4: chair      — libraryChair_S.png       (decoration)
    5: candle     — candleStand_S.png        (decoration)
    6: displayCase — displayCaseBooks_S.png  (decoration)

  Layers:
    "ground"  — every tile filled with floor (walkable)
    "decor"   — sparse decoration on top: bookshelves rim the south + east
                walls, tables + chairs in the centre, candle stands corner.

  Walkability: the canvas runtime currently sources walkable cells from the
  @br/mocks JSON fixture (mythenor.json). The Tiled map is rendered for
  visuals only in this v1; collision/walkability migration is the next pass
  via tools/tiled/tmj-to-tilemap.ts (future).
-->
